    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/f56d9c2fce7092522c5f5c8138889593.avif?t=1753108339\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>You Alone Can Defeat Evil</strong></i>\u00a0is an intense 2D top-down action-adventure game that immerses players in the role of a rogue Sorcerer from the enigmatic Order of Eskilon. As an outcast wielding forbidden magic, players must navigate a perilous journey filled with relentless challenges, dark mysteries, and the weight of a world teetering on the brink of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/4db112a298e9664953dcefd885ae7136.poster.avif?t=1753108339\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/4db112a298e9664953dcefd885ae7136.webm?t=1753108339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/4db112a298e9664953dcefd885ae7136.mp4?t=1753108339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/13eeeb4a3d24eea91adfb35cdc6517f6.avif?t=1753108339\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tasked with facing the Great Demon threatening humanity, players engage in fast-paced and unforgiving combat, uncover rich lore, and explore a world steeped in magic, conflict, and moral ambiguity.While designed as a single-player experience, the game holds secrets that extend beyond solo play, with additional details to be revealed soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/6de3de6c7decd5896ef1c9456f98f515.avif?t=1753108339\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rich Lore Exploration:</strong> Unlock the history of the mystical world through lore books earned in combat with the Great Demon. Each lore book reveals stories of historical figures and grants a new magical tattoo, imbuing the player with unique powers tied to the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Combat Mechanics:</strong> Take on the Great Demon and its army of lesser demons, overcoming isolation-driven challenges that add depth to every encounter. Death will be the norm, but mastering the mystical soul-based magic will be your reward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Innovative Respawn System:</strong> Death is only the beginning; players are revived through a mystical tattoo bond, intertwining body and soul to create a powerful, immersive gameplay loop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Secrets Beyond Single-Player:</strong> Though <i>You Alone Can Defeat Evil</i> is crafted as a single-player journey, it contains hidden elements that hint at experiences beyond traditional solo play. Stay tuned for more updates on these mysterious features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/0a936897ea088dafec311ad92ee0a3b8.poster.avif?t=1753108339\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/0a936897ea088dafec311ad92ee0a3b8.webm?t=1753108339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/0a936897ea088dafec311ad92ee0a3b8.mp4?t=1753108339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul>",
